WORDBLOOM MODIFICATIONS

In 2026, WordBloom contributors selected the Open English WordNet 2025 core dataset, excluded its separate proper-name dataset, normalized and filtered headwords, merged identical spellings, ranked candidates using wordfreq 3.1.1 with alphabetical tie-breaking, selected 20,000 entries, emitted compact browser data, and created an exact-lemma legacy migration map.

